              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ivyo vyose bimaze gukorwa, abarongozi baza aho ndi baravuga bati: “Abisirayeli, harimwo n’abaherezi n’Abalewi, ntibitandukanije n’abanyamahanga babana mu gihugu hamwe n’imigenzo yabo mibi birenze urugero, nk’iy’Abanyakanani, Abaheti, Abaperizi, Abayebusi, Abamoni, Abanyamowabu, Abanyegiputa n’Abamori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abagabo b’Abisirayeli babatoyemwo abakobwa babagira abagore babo kandi babakwera n’abahungu babo na bo. Ivyo vyatumye haba ikivange c’ubwoko bwera n’ayo mahanga. Kandi abarongozi n’abacamanza ni bo babaye aba mbere gukora ico kizira.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.9.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
