              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko hageze gutanga ikimazi co ku mugoroba, mpaguruka aho nari nicurikiririye, umwambaro wanje n’umutamana wanje vyatabutse, nca mpfukama hasi nduza amaboko ",
          "type": "text",
